   "description": "The McQuaide C1 Solstice is a tribute to the rhythms that shape our world. Representing the turning points of the year. Two steels are forge-welded, folded and etched in ferric chloride, so the pattern runs through the metal itself, and never laser-etched onto its surface. No two cases are ever completley alike. Specifications Case: forged Damascus Steel, 39mm, diameter, 12mm thickness, exhibition caseback Dial: red fume gradient, red-tipped seconds hand Movement: SW200-1 automatic Water resistance: 100m (10 ATM) Crystal: sapphire Lume: BGW9 Super-LumiNova Lug width: 22mm Strap: leather Warranty: 2 years",
